Subject: [PATCH] kernel: add IIO triggered buffer dependency for dps310 on 7.4

The Linux 7.4 DPS310 driver uses the triggered buffer helpers,
which must be packaged as a dependency.

--- a/package/kernel/linux/modules/iio.mk
+++ b/package/kernel/linux/modules/iio.mk
@@ -354,1 +354,1 @@
-  DEPENDS:=+kmod-regmap-i2c
+  DEPENDS:=+kmod-regmap-i2c +LINUX_7_4:kmod-industrialio-triggered-buffer
